Governance & Real-World Considerations
Monitoring: track prediction confidence and class-distribution drift over time.
Governance: health-adjacent, high-stakes use case — real deployment would require clinical validation beyond Cookie Theft, IRB/ethics oversight, and bias auditing across age, accent, dialect, and language groups.
Maintenance: version-controlled model artifacts, periodic re-evaluation with evaluate_model.py-style honest CV, rollback plan if retraining underperforms current baselines (76.3% / 61.8%).
Ethical note: false positives/negatives carry real emotional and medical weight — reflected in the in-app disclaimer and visible accuracy figures.
